  "title": "sfb_meg_phantom (B04/C01)",
  "description": "This dataset contains MEG phantom recordings designed to characterize deep brain stimulation (DBS) device-specific artefacts in magnetoencephalography. Using a Neuromag phantom setup, movement onset was captured with an accelerometer to assess artefact behavior associated with DBS hardware. The data support a study investigating how DBS devices affect MEG signal quality and interpretation.",
  "methods_description": "Movement onset during the Neuromag phantom measurement was recorded using an accelerometer, captured via channels MISC006-MISC008.",
